Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,In March 1922,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,six people vanished from a small farmstead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,in Bavaria. Andreas Gruber,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,his wife Cäzilia,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.76,0:00:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,their widowed daughter Viktoria,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.46,0:00:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and her four children had not been
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.08,0:00:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,seen for several days when a neighbor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,grew concerned and went to check on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,them. What that neighbor found at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinterkaifeck became one of the most
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.74,0:00:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,studied unsolved cases in German criminal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,history. In the weeks before,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the household had reported strange
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,occurrences. Footprints appeared in fresh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,snow, leading toward the farmhouse but
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,never away from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.96,0:00:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A newspaper no one recognized turned up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Keys went missing from locked doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Days before the family disappeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.04,0:00:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Andreas Gruber told a neighbor he had
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.92,0:00:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,heard footsteps in the attic,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.66,0:00:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,though the house was searched and found
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.28,0:00:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,empty. Investigators later determined the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,family had been killed and their bodies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.38,0:00:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,concealed in the barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.48,0:00:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite an extensive investigation and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:00:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,dozens of suspects considered over the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,following century, no one was ever
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.70,0:01:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,charged. The case remains formally open in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bavarian police records to this day.
